# The wikis hold personal content — kept local only, never published.
# The deployed function reads embeddings from Supabase, so it doesn't need
# these files at runtime; they're only used locally by scripts/build-wiki.js
# and scripts/embed.js.
#   wiki/             — full, detailed version (private; lives in ../personal-wiki now)
#   helium_wiki/      — sanitized version generated by build-wiki.js, embedded by embed.js
#   wiki-redactions/  — redaction policy (overrides + EXCLUDE list) consumed by build-wiki.js
wiki/
helium_wiki/
wiki-redactions/
tutorial
resume/